WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:04,040
Why are there four sandworms gathering at such a close distance?

2
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:06,870
Sandworms are very territorial

3
00:00:07,870 --> 00:00:08,870
Generally do not gather together

4
00:00:08,870 --> 00:00:09,870
Unless they are a family

5
00:00:10,870 --> 00:00:16,290
Don't act rashly yet

6
00:00:16,290 --> 00:00:17,290
They haven't dealt with it themselves yet

7
00:00:19,290 --> 00:00:38,700
Your small eyes are actually hidden under such a big mouth

8
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:44,120
mary save her
